WEBVTT

00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:01.680
Hi there!

00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:05.940
Sorry to keep all of you waiting!

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:09.310
Since Doremi's stuck like that,

00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:12.940
I guess it's up to me now!

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:14.990
In other words,

00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:17.890
Ojamajo Pop, coming right up!

00:00:17.890 --> 00:00:19.990
No way!

00:01:51.540 --> 00:01:53.560
Magical Stage!

00:01:55.520 --> 00:01:56.860
I saw it.

00:02:05.240 --> 00:02:07.340
Ojamajo Pop's Debut!?

00:02:10.370 --> 00:02:13.480
She found out! She found out! She found out!

00:02:13.870 --> 00:02:16.070
At this rate I'll be turned into a Witch Frog!

00:02:16.070 --> 00:02:17.680
It's okay, Doremi-chan.

00:02:18.030 --> 00:02:21.530
We aren't witches yet, we're only witch apprentices.

00:02:21.530 --> 00:02:23.840
Oh, I see.

00:02:24.470 --> 00:02:26.790
Hey, isn't that even worse!?

00:02:28.190 --> 00:02:31.130
This is bad! This is really bad!

00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:32.960
Calm down right now!

00:02:36.600 --> 00:02:38.420
So Plush-chan really can talk!

00:02:38.420 --> 00:02:41.000
My name is not Plush-chan!

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:42.390
I am a witch, Majo Rika!

00:02:42.390 --> 00:02:44.760
Yay! Plush-chan spoke! It spoke!

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:46.210
Did you hear me?

00:02:46.210 --> 00:02:48.100
In any case, can't you cast some spell?

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:51.310
We're all gonna turn into Witch Frogs at this rate!

00:02:51.310 --> 00:02:56.030
Didn't I tell you that you can't use magic to change the fate of a person?

00:02:56.030 --> 00:02:57.740
Then what about Pop?

00:02:58.360 --> 00:02:59.840
There's no other way.

00:02:59.840 --> 00:03:01.860
She'll become a witch apprentice too.

00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:06.120
Plush-chan! Thank you!

00:03:06.120 --> 00:03:07.620
I told you, it's Majo Rika!

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:10.170
Well then, nice to meet you!

00:03:10.170 --> 00:03:11.360
Nice to meet you.

00:03:11.360 --> 00:03:13.370
Nice to meet you, too!

00:03:13.370 --> 00:03:16.060
Why does <i>she </i> have to become a witch apprentice too?

00:03:16.540 --> 00:03:18.050
But wait.

00:03:18.050 --> 00:03:20.880
This way, I'm her senior...

00:03:20.880 --> 00:03:22.470
Pop.

00:03:23.090 --> 00:03:29.130
From now on, I, your level 6 witch apprentice-older sister, will teach you so many new things.

00:03:29.130 --> 00:03:30.560
She's feeling proud already.

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:32.640
Big sis Doremi!

00:03:33.270 --> 00:03:35.360
Big sis Doremi?

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:40.370
Big sis Doremi, how do witch apprentices transform?

00:03:40.370 --> 00:03:43.030
Well, you use this Apprentice Tap right here.

00:03:43.030 --> 00:03:45.490
Apprentice... Tap?

00:03:45.490 --> 00:03:47.200
Apprentice Tap.

00:03:49.860 --> 00:03:51.260
Apprentice Tap!

00:03:51.260 --> 00:03:52.420
Nope!

00:03:52.420 --> 00:03:56.140
Doremi and the others already took the last three.

00:03:56.140 --> 00:03:58.380
We can't give it to you today.

00:04:01.430 --> 00:04:04.050
Pop is going to help out at the Maho-dou too?

00:04:04.050 --> 00:04:06.090
Yup, starting tomorrow.

00:04:06.090 --> 00:04:07.280
But...

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:09.270
You are going on a trip soon with your kindergarten class, right?

00:04:09.270 --> 00:04:13.620
The teacher said that I can go help out during vacation.

00:04:14.390 --> 00:04:17.860
Well, as her big sis, I'll take good care of her.

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:19.680
Right, big sis Doremi?

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:21.140
Big sis...

00:04:21.140 --> 00:04:22.200
Doremi?

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:24.410
Yep, big sis Doremi.

00:04:25.890 --> 00:04:27.700
Okay, that's fine.

00:04:28.510 --> 00:04:30.410
Wait up, Pop!

00:04:31.390 --> 00:04:32.330
Good morning!

00:04:32.330 --> 00:04:33.340
Good morn-!

00:04:35.130 --> 00:04:37.240
Wait!

00:04:37.790 --> 00:04:38.370
Plush-chan!

00:04:38.370 --> 00:04:40.260
I told you, I'm Majo Rika!

00:04:40.260 --> 00:04:42.130
Plush-chan!

00:04:42.130 --> 00:04:46.770
In any case, even though we got the store back, we're in a lot of debt.

00:04:47.300 --> 00:04:49.060
Whose fault was that?

00:04:49.060 --> 00:04:49.940
Yeah.

00:04:49.940 --> 00:04:50.710
Wow.

00:04:52.180 --> 00:04:54.440
You girls don't have time to be fooling around.

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:58.400
You will be working here every day during summer vacation.

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:02.820
There will be no vacation for you girls.

00:05:02.820 --> 00:05:03.950
Plush-chan!

00:05:03.950 --> 00:05:06.530
My name is Majo Rika!

00:05:14.560 --> 00:05:21.950
~ Magic glue and many other such things and more. ~

00:05:21.950 --> 00:05:25.680
~ They call me Dela! ~

00:05:25.680 --> 00:05:27.690
Oh, good timing.
~ They call me Dela! ~

00:05:27.690 --> 00:05:29.470
I have a big order to make today.

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:32.970
Okay, here.

00:05:32.970 --> 00:05:35.100
That many?

00:05:35.100 --> 00:05:38.950
Wow, we can make anything with this!

00:05:40.210 --> 00:05:42.340
Majo Rika, the Apprentice Tap.

00:05:42.340 --> 00:05:44.190
Oh yeah.

00:05:44.190 --> 00:05:46.320
Oh? A new witch apprentice?

00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:48.020
I'm Pop!

00:05:48.570 --> 00:05:50.350
Okay, hold out your hands.

00:05:54.910 --> 00:05:57.920
Is this an Apprentice Tap?

00:05:57.920 --> 00:05:59.700
Yes, yes!
Okay then... It comes out to this.

00:05:59.700 --> 00:06:01.420
I'll treasure it!

00:06:01.420 --> 00:06:01.480
Okay then... It comes out to this.

00:06:05.380 --> 00:06:08.680
I guess we can't afford that Apprentice Tap now.

00:06:08.680 --> 00:06:11.270
Oh well, I can't help that.

00:06:11.270 --> 00:06:13.640
Now now, don't be so hasty.

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:17.080
Please rest a bit before leaving, pretty lady!

00:06:17.080 --> 00:06:17.940
Pretty?

00:06:17.940 --> 00:06:19.610
Okay, just for a little bit.

00:06:20.470 --> 00:06:22.710
Do you want me to massage your shoulders?

00:06:22.710 --> 00:06:24.480
What a sweet child you are.

00:06:24.480 --> 00:06:27.020
I really want that Apprentice Tap.

00:06:27.020 --> 00:06:31.310
Can't you make it a little cheaper?

00:06:31.310 --> 00:06:33.760
Pretty and nice lady.

00:06:33.760 --> 00:06:35.200
Pretty and nice?

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:38.840
Pretty and nice and wonderful lady!

00:06:38.840 --> 00:06:40.780
Pretty and nice and wonderful?

00:06:40.780 --> 00:06:41.960
Okay...!

00:06:41.960 --> 00:06:42.780
Give me a second...

00:06:42.780 --> 00:06:45.340
I can't help it now.

00:06:46.380 --> 00:06:47.880
How about this?

00:06:48.940 --> 00:06:50.300
Deal!

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:54.150
Okay, please pay up at the end of the month.

00:06:56.000 --> 00:06:58.110
Nice one, Pop.

00:06:58.750 --> 00:07:01.770
Now I'll teach you magic as a reward!

00:07:02.950 --> 00:07:03.730
Listen up, Pop.

00:07:03.730 --> 00:07:08.690
First, you press the button in the center of the Tap and then change before the music ends.

00:07:08.690 --> 00:07:09.950
Got it!

00:07:15.930 --> 00:07:19.120
When you are done, try tapping Do-Mi-So-Do in succession.

00:07:19.120 --> 00:07:20.420
Okay!

00:07:23.850 --> 00:07:26.460
Pretty Witchy Pop-chi!

00:07:33.900 --> 00:07:35.400
That's your Peperuto Poron.

00:07:36.010 --> 00:07:40.430
Try swinging it while saying "Pipitto Puritto Puritan Peperuto,"

00:07:40.430 --> 00:07:43.260
then say what you want to do.

00:07:43.260 --> 00:07:44.350
Alright!

00:07:45.340 --> 00:07:50.400
Pipitto Puritto Puritan Peperuto!

00:07:50.860 --> 00:07:53.920
Huge pudding, come out!

00:07:59.250 --> 00:08:01.100
Great success!

00:08:01.100 --> 00:08:02.040
How can you call it a...

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:04.220
great success?

00:08:05.100 --> 00:08:06.490
But it ain't bad.

00:08:06.490 --> 00:08:07.520
Ai-chan?

00:08:07.520 --> 00:08:10.230
It was a pretty good spell.

00:08:15.850 --> 00:08:18.470
Her courage gets full points too.

00:08:18.470 --> 00:08:20.370
She's just flying around.

00:08:20.370 --> 00:08:22.810
Okay! Here we go!

00:08:22.810 --> 00:08:27.110
She's different than someone else I know...

00:08:29.570 --> 00:08:31.780
Now, get to work! Work!

00:08:33.520 --> 00:08:34.740
Me too!

00:08:35.500 --> 00:08:36.190
Here.

00:08:37.220 --> 00:08:38.740
New people start with cleaning.

00:08:40.120 --> 00:08:43.490
Big sis Doremi is a level 6 witch apprentice.

00:08:43.490 --> 00:08:45.560
Pop hasn't even passed level 9.

00:08:45.560 --> 00:08:46.830
Who's better?

00:09:10.530 --> 00:09:12.050
I'm done!

00:09:16.140 --> 00:09:17.810
It's all sparkly!

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:20.250
She's completely different than you.

00:09:24.890 --> 00:09:26.960
Pop-chan, what are you making?

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:28.900
Let's see...

00:09:28.900 --> 00:09:31.920
This is a rolypoly and this is a lazybug.

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:34.790
This is a chameleon and this is a hercules beetle.

00:09:34.790 --> 00:09:36.090
Sure sounds interesting.

00:09:36.090 --> 00:09:37.250
Yup!

00:09:38.620 --> 00:09:40.550
Those things won't sell.

00:09:40.550 --> 00:09:42.060
Of course they will.

00:09:42.060 --> 00:09:43.660
Nope, nope.

00:09:44.270 --> 00:09:46.480
Before talking about her, what about you?

00:09:47.290 --> 00:09:49.730
Thank you very much!

00:09:53.670 --> 00:09:55.400
I knew that your things wouldn't sell.

00:09:55.400 --> 00:09:57.120
You too, Doremi.

00:10:01.700 --> 00:10:04.760
Wow, amazing!

00:10:04.760 --> 00:10:06.500
These daring colors...

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:08.720
Amazing forms...

00:10:08.720 --> 00:10:11.710
These are masterpieces of art!

00:10:12.700 --> 00:10:14.420
I want them all!

00:10:14.770 --> 00:10:16.510
Thank you very much!

00:10:21.150 --> 00:10:23.510
Your total is 5,000 yen.

00:10:23.510 --> 00:10:25.720
The work you do is wonderful.

00:10:25.720 --> 00:10:28.060
Thank you very much!

00:10:28.060 --> 00:10:30.770
I actually lost to to my little sister Pop...

00:10:31.470 --> 00:10:35.820
Maybe I really am the world's unluckiest pretty girl!

00:10:42.160 --> 00:10:43.620
I'm going now!

00:10:43.620 --> 00:10:45.770
Don't wet the bed.

00:10:45.770 --> 00:10:47.550
I'm not you.

00:10:47.550 --> 00:10:48.450
What was that!?

00:10:49.170 --> 00:10:52.720
Don't tell me you're bringing your Apprentice Tap with you?

00:10:52.720 --> 00:10:55.470
Of course. It's my treasure.

00:10:55.470 --> 00:10:57.290
Don't you dare use it.

00:10:57.290 --> 00:10:58.870
Okay!

00:10:58.870 --> 00:11:00.110
Later!

00:11:00.110 --> 00:11:01.050
I'll send her off.

00:11:01.050 --> 00:11:02.130
Okay.

00:11:04.290 --> 00:11:06.240
Will she really be okay?

00:11:29.500 --> 00:11:32.830
Pop-chan! Come sleep with us!

00:11:33.260 --> 00:11:37.710
No! Pop-chan is sleeping with us!

00:11:37.710 --> 00:11:39.250
Calm down...

00:11:39.250 --> 00:11:40.170
Out of my way!

00:11:40.170 --> 00:11:42.590
We'll be sleeping here!

00:11:42.590 --> 00:11:44.590
Yep, we will!

00:11:44.590 --> 00:11:47.600
What is this? I got this place first!

00:11:47.600 --> 00:11:50.310
Well, you can sleep next to me.

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:51.660
No way.

00:11:51.660 --> 00:11:52.870
Let's go, everyone.

00:11:57.400 --> 00:11:59.190
Hey.

00:11:59.190 --> 00:12:02.060
It's summer vacation, so it's kind of pointless to open shop every day.

00:12:02.060 --> 00:12:03.650
Yeah.

00:12:03.650 --> 00:12:06.090
We should only open on weekends.

00:12:06.090 --> 00:12:07.080
No!

00:12:07.630 --> 00:12:11.240
In order to pay up at the end of the month, every little bit counts!

00:12:11.240 --> 00:12:12.780
Oh yeah, where's Pop?

00:12:12.780 --> 00:12:14.290
She's at her kindergarten.

00:12:14.930 --> 00:12:17.500
I'm really worried.

00:12:17.500 --> 00:12:19.960
I feel like that she'll use magic without thinking.

00:12:20.660 --> 00:12:22.930
Pop-chan will be fine.

00:12:22.930 --> 00:12:25.270
She ain't that hasty.

00:12:25.890 --> 00:12:28.640
Yer such a worrywart, Doremi-chan.

00:12:28.640 --> 00:12:29.430
Yep, yep.

00:12:29.430 --> 00:12:30.530
She'll be fine.

00:12:30.530 --> 00:12:31.890
You're thinking too much.

00:12:34.470 --> 00:12:35.900
Well then, everyone.

00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:38.400
It's time to eat!

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:41.070
It tastes better when everyone's eating together!

00:12:41.070 --> 00:12:41.860
Yep.

00:12:44.460 --> 00:12:47.450
Kazuhiro-kun, what's wrong?

00:12:50.220 --> 00:12:52.520
I know that you wet your bed.

00:12:52.520 --> 00:12:54.030
N-No I don't...

00:12:54.030 --> 00:12:56.290
Bedwetter, bedwetter...

00:12:56.290 --> 00:12:57.250
Stop that!

00:12:57.250 --> 00:12:59.960
You're loud! You shut up!

00:12:59.960 --> 00:13:01.900
What!?

00:13:01.900 --> 00:13:02.890
Pop-chan!

00:13:04.320 --> 00:13:06.090
Please sit down while we're eating.

00:13:07.090 --> 00:13:08.220
Okay.

00:13:13.670 --> 00:13:16.330
When you're done, please put them in the bucket.

00:13:16.330 --> 00:13:18.020
Okay!

00:13:20.320 --> 00:13:21.980
I'm a space shuttle!

00:13:22.580 --> 00:13:23.570
That's dangerous!

00:13:25.330 --> 00:13:26.480
Kimitaka-kun.

00:13:28.190 --> 00:13:31.410
Didn't I tell you not to point the fireworks at other students?

00:13:32.080 --> 00:13:33.360
Okay.

00:13:45.200 --> 00:13:46.870
Did you brush your teeth?

00:13:48.930 --> 00:13:51.840
Then let's have a pillow fight.

00:13:55.890 --> 00:13:58.660
I want to go home.

00:13:59.340 --> 00:14:00.900
Kazuhiro-kun.

00:14:02.420 --> 00:14:05.640
It's not gonna work out if you're not here, Kazuhiro-kun.

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:12.740
I wanted the two of us to punish Kimitaka.

00:14:12.740 --> 00:14:13.740
But...

00:14:14.190 --> 00:14:16.210
We're whacking watermelons tomorrow too.

00:14:18.860 --> 00:14:22.180
When I'm whacking it, please cheer me on.

00:14:22.180 --> 00:14:23.040
Okay.

00:14:23.040 --> 00:14:25.800
We're having a scavenger hunt after that.

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:28.650
I-I-I'm the best at scavenger hunts.

00:14:29.620 --> 00:14:31.380
Then let's do it together tomorrow.

00:14:31.850 --> 00:14:32.890
Okay!

00:14:34.900 --> 00:14:35.670
Let's go.

00:14:35.670 --> 00:14:36.520
Okay.

00:14:36.520 --> 00:14:40.220
Okay, let's beat Kimitaka!

00:14:42.110 --> 00:14:44.990
Majo Rika wanted me to come take a look,

00:14:44.990 --> 00:14:46.570
but I think she's doing just fine.

00:14:46.570 --> 00:14:49.110
Okay, are you ready?

00:14:49.110 --> 00:14:49.660
Go!

00:14:50.560 --> 00:14:52.120
Take that!

00:14:52.530 --> 00:14:54.540
Go!

00:15:06.050 --> 00:15:12.390
I should be happy that Pop is gone, but why do I feel so uneasy?

00:15:14.190 --> 00:15:15.930
It's no use worrying.

00:15:15.930 --> 00:15:16.850
I'll go to sleep.

00:15:16.850 --> 00:15:18.540
Good night, Dodo.

00:15:30.750 --> 00:15:32.530
Who's making that strange noise?

00:15:32.530 --> 00:15:34.530
Did you know?

00:15:34.530 --> 00:15:38.150
When someone goes to the bathroom in the kindergarten alone at night,

00:15:38.150 --> 00:15:41.210
they will meet a family of ghosts.

00:15:42.700 --> 00:15:45.460
So scary!

00:15:46.130 --> 00:15:47.960
I want to go home!

00:15:48.490 --> 00:15:50.090
Stop that!

00:15:50.090 --> 00:15:52.340
Are you scared?

00:15:52.340 --> 00:15:53.460
A family of ghosts!

00:15:53.460 --> 00:15:54.470
Kimitaka!

00:15:55.060 --> 00:15:57.680
Hey! Who's up talking this late?

00:15:57.680 --> 00:16:02.190
If you don't quiet down, you won't be able to whack watermelons or go on the scavenger hunt.

00:16:02.190 --> 00:16:04.900
Sleep tight. Good night.

00:16:09.230 --> 00:16:10.930
Kimitaka.

00:16:10.930 --> 00:16:11.740
I won't forgive you!

00:16:26.900 --> 00:16:28.000
Gotta pee...

00:16:37.040 --> 00:16:38.310
Here I go!

00:16:53.280 --> 00:16:55.820
Pretty Witchy Pop-chi!

00:16:56.310 --> 00:17:01.790
Pipitto Puritto Puritan Peperuto!

00:17:02.420 --> 00:17:05.250
Ghosts, come out!

00:17:08.540 --> 00:17:09.460
What the?

00:17:22.950 --> 00:17:25.560
We want you... Kimitaka-kun...

00:17:30.520 --> 00:17:31.690
Gotcha!

00:17:33.650 --> 00:17:35.360
Ahhh! Oh no!

00:17:35.900 --> 00:17:41.290
Pipitto Puritto Puritan Peperuto!

00:17:41.290 --> 00:17:43.540
Come back!

00:17:47.370 --> 00:17:52.000
Pipitto Puritto Puritan Peperuto!

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:53.920
Go somewhere else!

00:17:56.830 --> 00:17:58.470
Actually, wait!

00:17:58.470 --> 00:18:00.880
T-T-This is bad.

00:18:10.120 --> 00:18:11.270
This is bad!

00:18:26.180 --> 00:18:28.210
Doremi, Doremi!

00:18:29.570 --> 00:18:30.170
Lala?

00:18:30.170 --> 00:18:32.040
Pop's in trouble!

00:18:36.500 --> 00:18:38.320
Doremi-chan!

00:18:38.320 --> 00:18:40.810
Girls! Thanks for coming with me!

00:18:40.810 --> 00:18:42.640
Lala already told us.

00:18:46.100 --> 00:18:47.560
This is bad.

00:18:51.040 --> 00:18:51.970
Pop.

00:18:52.690 --> 00:18:53.730
Doremi!

00:18:53.730 --> 00:18:55.240
Why didn't you listen to me?

00:19:00.490 --> 00:19:02.490
Ai-chan, Hadzuki-chan.

00:19:02.490 --> 00:19:04.700
Magical Stage, right?

00:19:04.700 --> 00:19:05.700
Alright.

00:19:06.420 --> 00:19:08.710
Pirika Pirilala Carefreely!

00:19:12.170 --> 00:19:15.810
Paipai Ponpoi Flexibly!

00:19:18.260 --> 00:19:21.600
Pameruku Laruku Proudly!

00:19:31.920 --> 00:19:33.740
Magical Stage!

00:19:39.620 --> 00:19:41.780
Have everyone fall asleep!

00:20:07.010 --> 00:20:08.420
Get it together, Pop.

00:20:09.140 --> 00:20:12.560
You created those ghosts, so you need to make them disappear.

00:20:13.960 --> 00:20:14.810
But...

00:20:15.980 --> 00:20:18.210
If you calm down, you can do it.

00:20:19.130 --> 00:20:19.970
I got it.

00:20:19.970 --> 00:20:20.780
I'll try it.

00:20:22.250 --> 00:20:27.740
Pipitto Puritto Puritan Peperuto!

00:20:28.990 --> 00:20:30.880
Ghosts, disappear!

00:20:34.170 --> 00:20:35.610
Yes!

00:20:35.610 --> 00:20:36.730
You did it!

00:20:36.730 --> 00:20:37.880
Yeah!

00:20:37.880 --> 00:20:40.630
Okay, it's time to clean up.

00:20:40.630 --> 00:20:45.090
But I used up all my magic spheres.

00:20:45.090 --> 00:20:46.650
Same here.

00:20:47.640 --> 00:20:48.850
Then what should we do?

00:20:51.230 --> 00:20:53.810
I guess we have to get all of them.

00:20:55.780 --> 00:20:57.850
Everything should be fine now.

00:20:57.850 --> 00:20:59.300
Yeah.

00:20:59.300 --> 00:21:01.300
We should go home too.

00:21:07.770 --> 00:21:08.700
Pop.

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:13.270
I'll have Majo Rika lecture you later.

00:21:14.700 --> 00:21:15.540
Thank you.

00:21:30.640 --> 00:21:33.180
I had a strange dream last night.

00:21:33.180 --> 00:21:34.310
Me too.

00:21:34.310 --> 00:21:37.160
I dreamed about ghosts last night.

00:21:37.160 --> 00:21:38.420
Really? Me too.

00:21:38.420 --> 00:21:40.770
Did I bump my head in my dream?

00:21:40.770 --> 00:21:43.410
Looks like we fooled everyone.

00:21:43.410 --> 00:21:46.400
Yes, Doremi and the others did well.

00:21:46.400 --> 00:21:48.470
Here!

00:21:50.170 --> 00:21:51.540
Yes!

00:21:52.320 --> 00:21:55.260
That one sure has a lot of potential to grow.

00:21:55.260 --> 00:21:59.960
Okay, I'll try my best from now on too!

00:22:02.400 --> 00:22:05.150
Lately, Kanae-chan's family has not been doing so well.

00:22:05.150 --> 00:22:06.720
I heard that her mom's in the hospital!

00:22:06.720 --> 00:22:08.580
And that a robber broke into her house!

00:22:08.580 --> 00:22:11.640
Okay, leave her happiness to us, the Pureleine!

00:22:11.640 --> 00:22:12.740
The Pureleine?

00:22:12.740 --> 00:22:15.360
We'll be the witch apprentices who protect everyone's happiness!

00:22:15.360 --> 00:22:18.600
Our magic power will be three times that of normal Ojamajos.

00:22:18.600 --> 00:22:20.020
Three times!?

00:22:20.020 --> 00:22:22.370
We'll fix everyone's misfortunes.

00:22:22.750 --> 00:22:23.920
Ojamajo Doremi!

00:22:23.920 --> 00:22:26.200
We are the Pureleine!

00:22:26.200 --> 00:22:29.300
Happy! Lucky! For all of you!
